# Route: guide 40 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 59, 36 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thunder Bluff, Blasted Lands, Loch Modan, Felwood, Durotar,
# Stranglethorn Vale, Alterac Mountains): Thunder Bluff -> Dreadmaul Hold ->
# Serpent's Coil -> The Dark Portal -> Altar of Storms -> Nethergarde Keep ->
# Stonesplinter Valley -> Stonewrought Dam -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Jaedenar ->
# Irontree Woods -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Bloodvenom Falls -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Arikara (5088; Arikara 28);
# Necklace Recovery (2283; Shadowforge Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian
# 36-37, Shadowforge Digger 35-36, Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault
# Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave Hunter 36-37); The Star, the Hand and the
# Heart (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying
# 44); The Crown of Will (519; Targ 41, Muckrake 40, Glommus 39).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing
# an Enemy's Strength (5723), Heart of Disruption (96984), The Grave Knight
# (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987).

